## Research notes

- Verified metadata from accessible sources (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists Claude Opus 4.7 (Max) as a deprecated proprietary reasoning model (released 2026-04-16) with 1M-token context, knowledge cutoff January 1, 2026, text/image input and text output, pricing ~$5.00/$25.00 per 1M input/output tokens, TTFT ~17.25s and output speed ~78 tok/s (Anthropic API context). OpenRouter lists `anthropic/claude-opus-4.7` with provider routing/pricing and capabilities.
- Artificial Analysis reported the Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A for this model in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, Terminal-Bench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
